<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0705_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gaven</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you tough. I ain’t\nscrapped that serious in a minute.\rCould I get your number?\rI’d like to scrap again after I heal\nmy homies. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How do I beat you? Them thoughts\nhauntin’ me ALL the time...\fI see your face when I close my eyes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK... I get it...\nBut if you change your mind, holla\fanytime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Could I get your number?\rI’d like to scrap again after I\nheal my homies. {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? This voice...\nYou right nearby, ain’t you?\fLet’s talk in person.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} might be greater than I\nimagined.\rI doubt I’ll see a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} better\nthan mine.\fI’ve looked. For months.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A while back, I tried to catch a wild\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\rIt got away.\rOne wrong move could mean TOTAL\nfailure... You be careful too.\fI think about this a lot.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I BARELY beat a\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} the other day.\rI ain’t never seen a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\nget that strong...\rDon’t let your guard down, even\nagainst a homie you used\fto seein’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s scrap!\rI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nHolla when you close.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, why ain’t you here?\rI’mma take you down on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, why ain’t you here?\rI’mma take you down on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0705_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, I just can’t get over how\nstrong you...\rI obsess over how to beat you EVERY\nsingle day...\fI made a wall. With string. And photos.\fIt’s normal. It’s research.</language>
	</row>
</body>
